{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Game you dive into a world of twisted minds as you embark on the search for a lost man. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a classical Survival Horror Fashion in the First Person Perspective you will solve puzzles, will interact with the world and get to explore a handcrafted world! Manage your Inventory with care as you might not carry everything you collect at once. Fight off enemies with Melee and Range weapons you can find on your travels and experience the Stories of a once thriving place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Places which once were thriving. Now abandoned and stripped of their Purpose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Puzzles which were carefully crafted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off Enemies with Weapons the people left behind but still might be useful to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth a Story which might not be what it first seems!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your inventory might be harder than you think!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844110?t=1753521468","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844110/e40e8bcd985b3d6743444b7f18e77dcbb23fca77/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753521468","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844110/8ca830afaf937566bb3602154049f3c995f679db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753521468","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844110/8ca830afaf937566bb3602154049f3c995f679db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753521468","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descripto